{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/azure-powershell","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:18:44.458Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/azure-powershell/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/azure-powershell/azure-powershell/about"},"readme":"## About\n\nThis repository contains the official container images for Microsoft Azure PowerShell. You can run a stand alone Docker container with Azure PowerShell modules pre-installed. This image can also be used as a base for your own deployments. The image tag refers to the version of [Az PowerShell module](https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/Az) it supports.\n\nThe container images are built on the latest [PowerShell images](https://hub.docker.com/_/microsoft-powershell) at the moment of release.\n\n## Featured Tags\n\n- [`latest`](https://github.com/Azure/azure-powershell/tree/main/docker/Dockerfile-ubuntu-20.04): The image with the latest stable Azure PowerShell modules.\n  - Ubuntu 20.04\n  - `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-powershell:latest`\n\n## What is Azure PowerShell\n\nAzure PowerShell is a set of cmdlets for managing Azure resources directly from the PowerShell command-line. Azure PowerShell is designed to make it easy to learn and get started with, but provides powerful features for automation. Written in .NET Standard, Azure PowerShell is supported on the supported versions of PowerShell as described on the [PowerShell Support Lifecycle](https://docs.microsoft.com/powershell/scripting/powershell-support-lifecycle) page.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSee our [documentation](http://aka.ms/azpsdockerreadme).\n\n## Usage\n\n`docker run -it mcr.microsoft.com/azure-powershell:<version>`\n\nFor more information on how to use this image, please refer to our [documentation](http://aka.ms/azpsdockerreadme).\n\n## Support\n\nIf you have any problems with or questions about this image, please contact us through a [GitHub issue](https://aka.ms/azpsissue).\n\n## Feedback\n\nTo provide feedback please open an issue [Feedback](https://aka.ms/azpsissue).\n\n## License\n\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\nSee our [License](https://github.com/Azure/azure-powershell/blob/main/LICENSE.txt)","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-10T08:06:09.2812548+00:00","categories":["Programming Languages","DevOps Tools"],"keywords":[],"license":"Apache-2.0","links":[{"name":"licence","url":"https://github.com/Azure/azure-powershell/blob/main/LICENSE.txt"}],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"20.1M+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"16.3.0-azurelinux-3.0-arm64","digest":"sha256:b99a10649c5bb1cdd10a3fb26fbad59c02a1aff3f797dca1c4a1f31dfbed0890","pushed":"2026-09-10T04:27:48.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"azurelinux-3.0-arm64","digest":"sha256:b99a10649c5bb1cdd10a3fb26fbad59c02a1aff3f797dca1c4a1f31dfbed0890","pushed":"2026-09-10T04:27:38.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"ubuntu-24.04","digest":"sha256:cc60df772557ed2e3f8f4fe2faaccc34b4b8a33a42f5e1ba7fa17a709904ee3f","pushed":"2026-09-10T04:26:19.0000000+00:00","size":7138,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"debian-12","digest":"sha256:8854d0507dfb8fef795c894955692550722e9eae9eebee7586ab56134fc9d483","pushed":"2026-09-10T04:26:12.0000000+00:00","size":6527,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"azurelinux-3.0","digest":"sha256:b88208de6a9ceecac4d54afe3c27195c6eba8070adb5fa0460758040f13dc0cc"